      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think it might be possible to do this without a huge restructuring of how variables are declared. What if we just moved out the \"Detect the declaration of magical variables\" section of `convertVarDeclaration` into a separate function in IRGenerator? That would allow DSL to call it directly as needed, and keeps the structure of things the same.",
      "revId": "86c72897086f5df3702ab8e3bd53e67f5a62e64c",
